
Variables can be defined in `project.ssg` or with `set`. Use `var` to retrieve a variable.

## Bases

Bases are JSON files stored in `plooglybases/` directory. They store structured data that can be iterated and manipulated with commands like `iter_base`, `sortbase_by_key`, `cutbase_extension`, etc.

